  "id": "chicken-with-artichokes-and-mushrooms",
  "name": "Chicken with Artichokes and Mushrooms",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken baked in a savory mushroom-artichoke sauce",
  "description": "Seasoned chicken, mushrooms, and marinated artichokes come together in a sherry-mustard sauce for a simple baked main dish.",
